# Generated per task by make_task.py / make_vague_prompt.py / preflight_task.sh.
# They hold the hidden tests (test.patch) and the reference implementation (mask.patch, gold.patch):
# keep them out of commits. Regenerate them from the dataset (see RUN_NEW_PROMPT.md).
tasks/*/prompt.txt
tasks/*/mask.patch
tasks/*/test.patch
tasks/*/gold.patch
tasks/*/preflight/
tasks/*/preflight.json*
tasks/*/preflight.log
tasks/*/prompt_vague.*
harness/__pycache__/
